DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
29859::$$$message_0219_0000_0000$$$::The curtain falls.[lr]::
29860::$$$message_0219_0000_0001$$$::A buzzer sounds the end of the play, and the house sinks into darkness.[lr]::
29861::$$$message_0219_0000_0002$$$::The slumber is deep. We won't reawaken until the morning of the fifth day.[lr]::
29862::$$$message_0219_0000_0003$$$::We won't meet again.::
29863::$$$message_0219_0001_0000$$$::"...What a weight off my back, though.[lr]::
29864::$$$message_0219_0001_0001$$$::Well, hard to get attached in just four days."[lr]::
29865::$$$message_0219_0001_0002$$$::I never had anyone to say farewell to, nor any luggage to take with me.[lr]::
29866::$$$message_0219_0001_0003$$$::I just wave goodbye and leave center stage.::
29867::$$$message_0219_0002_0000$$$::Soon, the date will change.[lr]::
29868::$$$message_0219_0002_0001$$$::The black moon turns to kill me for remaining until the fourth night.[lr]::
29869::$$$message_0219_0002_0002$$$::Now I go to destroy its source.[lr]::
29870::$$$message_0219_0002_0003$$$::The dream ends, and the puzzle is complete.[lr]::
29871::$$$message_0219_0002_0004$$$::I'm going straight to the last gap that brings forth the hollow to paint it over.::
29872::$$$message_0219_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29873::$$$message_0219_0003_0001$$$::I suppress a scream and press on.[lr]::
29874::$$$message_0219_0003_0002$$$::I can reach the empty sky from this tower.[lr]::
29875::$$$message_0219_0003_0003$$$::Now that I'm aware of what I am, the path to return to where I belong should appear...::
29876::$$$message_0219_0004_0000$$$::As the fourth day's play begins to end, I arrive at the landing of the stairs continuing into the void.[lr]::
29877::$$$message_0219_0004_0001$$$::The moon is colored black, and husks emerge to engulf the town.[lr]::
29878::$$$message_0219_0004_0002$$$::My body is reaching its time limit, and I start to melt into a monster that isn't me.[lr]::
29879::$$$message_0219_0004_0003$$$::And there...::
29880::$$$message_0219_0005_0000$$$::"...Well, how about that."[lr]::
29881::$$$message_0219_0005_0001$$$::Someone is on the roof.[lr]::
29882::$$$message_0219_0005_0002$$$::Her silver hair sways, and just as always...[lr]::
29883::$$$message_0219_0005_0003$$$::"Isn't coming all the way out here too much of a freebie?"[lr]::
29884::$$$message_0219_0005_0004$$$::...my guide is here to scold me.::
29885::$$$message_0219_0006_0000$$$::"...It isn't excessive. It's practically become a custom to meet you on the fourth night."[lr]::
29886::$$$message_0219_0006_0001$$$::No hesitation. She's as blunt as ever.::
29887::$$$message_0219_0007_0000$$$::"...Well, yeah. So what are you here for this time?"[lr]::
29888::$$$message_0219_0007_0001$$$::"I am here as your escort. I don't know how far you'll make it, but I thought I might accompany you."[lr]::
29889::$$$message_0219_0007_0002$$$::She dares me to object.::
29890::$$$message_0219_0008_0000$$$::"...Ha."[lr]::
29891::$$$message_0219_0008_0001$$$::I find myself grinning.[lr]::
29892::$$$message_0219_0008_0002$$$::Damn. Now I can't help but get all gung-ho about this.::
29893::$$$message_0219_0009_0000$$$::"You're giving away the farm. I don't think you're obligated to go that far."[lr]::
29894::$$$message_0219_0009_0001$$$::"Does that bother you?"[lr]::
29895::$$$message_0219_0009_0002$$$::"The opposite. I'm so grateful I could cry. It's shitty I have no one to show off to. Having anyone next to me helps, no matter who it is.[lr]::
29896::$$$message_0219_0009_0003$$$::A friend in need is a friend indeed."[cacheimage storage=カレン戦闘服03h(遠)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=カレン戦闘服03h(遠)][wait canskip=0 time=1000][clfg pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400][texton]::
29897::$$$message_0219_0010_0000$$$::I start walking toward the void.[lr]::
29898::$$$message_0219_0010_0001$$$::The path to the Holy Grail appears, as if to greet its master.::
29899::$$$message_0219_0011_0000$$$::"Hey, you afraid of heights?"[lr]::
29900::$$$message_0219_0011_0001$$$::"I am not afraid. I've fallen from that moon before, after all."::
29901::$$$message_0219_0012_0000$$$::"All right. Then stick with me until I get there. I might step off the path on my own."[lr]::
29902::$$$message_0219_0012_0001$$$::I turn and offer her my hand.[lr]::
29903::$$$message_0219_0012_0002$$$::I'm motivated, so I'll be able to remain true to myself.::
29904::$$$message_0219_0013_0000$$$::"...That goes without saying.[lr]::
29905::$$$message_0219_0013_0001$$$::I met you here in order to be your guide."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
29906::$$$message_0219_0014_0000$$$::We join hands and overlap our fingers.[lr]::
29907::$$$message_0219_0014_0001$$$::If I take one step away from the surface of the earth, I'll turn into my original self.[lr]::
29908::$$$message_0219_0014_0002$$$::   The play comes to a close.[lr]::
29909::$$$message_0219_0014_0003$$$::   The lead role ends here.[lr]::
29910::$$$message_0219_0014_0004$$$::Far away, Miyama is awash in red light.[lr]::
29911::$$$message_0219_0014_0005$$$::There's no time to stop.[lr]::
29912::$$$message_0219_0014_0006$$$::The last reel of film begins to roll in the closed theater.::
29913::$$$message_0219_0015_0000$$$::Reality fades with each step forward.[lr]::
29914::$$$message_0219_0015_0001$$$::Time stagnates with each step upward.::
29915::$$$message_0219_0016_0000$$$::It's only been a few minutes since I started climbing,[lr]::
29916::$$$message_0219_0016_0001$$$::but the time and distance traveled are so terribly long, I can't remember them anymore.::
29917::$$$message_0219_0017_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29918::$$$message_0219_0017_0001$$$::I'm losing my features.[lr]::
29919::$$$message_0219_0017_0002$$$::Occasionally, I feel as if I'll collapse to my creaking limbs and boiling impulses.[lr]::
29920::$$$message_0219_0017_0003$$$::But I'm not the only one being hurt.[lr]::
29921::$$$message_0219_0017_0004$$$::Holding my hand, her face contorts in pain as we ascend.[lr]::
29922::$$$message_0219_0017_0005$$$::She's the perfect partner to show off for.::
29923::$$$message_0219_0018_0000$$$::"Ahh...I wonder how long this goes."[lr]::
29924::$$$message_0219_0018_0001$$$::I grumble and <show off my humanity> as I climb the long stairs.[lr]::
29925::$$$message_0219_0018_0002$$$::Speaking of which...[lr]::
29926::$$$message_0219_0018_0003$$$::Shirou Emiya had a similar memory.[lr]::
29927::$$$message_0219_0018_0004$$$::We climb the long stairs together.[lr]::
29928::$$$message_0219_0018_0005$$$::...I wonder when that happened.[lr]::
29929::$$$message_0219_0018_0006$$$::It was just an hour ago, but I've already forgotten.::
29930::$$$message_0219_0019_0000$$$::"...Look. The red light is ending."[lr]::
29931::$$$message_0219_0019_0001$$$::I look down at where she's pointing to the surface.[lr]::
29932::$$$message_0219_0019_0002$$$::The monsters are out in full force, but they've stopped short of Shinto.[lr]::
29933::$$$message_0219_0019_0003$$$::Red light has completely engulfed Miyama.[lr]::
29934::$$$message_0219_0019_0004$$$::My own husks run rampant over the sleeping town.[lr]::
29935::$$$message_0219_0019_0005$$$::I watch the sickening sight unfold.::
29936::$$$message_0219_0020_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29937::$$$message_0219_0020_0001$$$::I climb the stairs.[lr]::
29938::$$$message_0219_0020_0002$$$::The surface of the earth is far, but the sky is close.[lr]::
29939::$$$message_0219_0020_0003$$$::The embodiment of a dream. Somebody's wish.[lr]::
29940::$$$message_0219_0020_0004$$$::Everything that was wished for but never granted grows more distant with each step,[lr]::
29941::$$$message_0219_0020_0005$$$::like a story on the shores of a distant land, that has nothing to do with me anymore.::
29942::$$$message_0219_0021_0000$$$::How many times have I walked through that town?[lr]::
29943::$$$message_0219_0021_0001$$$::How many times have I experienced that life?[lr]::
29944::$$$message_0219_0021_0002$$$::There's no place there I don't know,[lr]::
29945::$$$message_0219_0021_0003$$$::no event I haven't experienced.[lr]::
29946::$$$message_0219_0021_0004$$$::It was a completely unknown blank sheet that I filled in with each repetition.[lr]::
29947::$$$message_0219_0021_0005$$$::It lost its light as I filled in the blanks.[lr]::
29948::$$$message_0219_0021_0006$$$::The more I loved life and sought out new days, the more it lost its intrigue. Its brilliance.[lr]::
29949::$$$message_0219_0021_0007$$$::I've been well aware of this outcome from the start.::
29950::$$$message_0219_0022_0000$$$::I've had more than my share of fun.[lr]::
29951::$$$message_0219_0022_0001$$$::I don't need anything new now.[lr]::
29952::$$$message_0219_0022_0002$$$::I can honor the contract to repeat these same four days forever.[lr]::
29953::$$$message_0219_0022_0003$$$::Then why did I keep doing something I didn't need to do?[lr]::
29954::$$$message_0219_0022_0004$$$::I can't blame this shrouded personality for all of it.[lr]::
29955::$$$message_0219_0022_0005$$$::I probably just got bored. That's all the reason I need. I'm bored of it, so I want to end it.[move textoff=0 time=300 path=(0,0,220)(0,0,0)(0,0,200)(0,0,150)(0,0,100)(0,0,50)(0,0,0) storage=アンリフィルター_5 accel=0] That has to be why. Otherwise...[lr]::
29956::$$$message_0219_0022_0006$$$::I'll want to abandon it all.::
29957::$$$message_0219_0023_0000$$$::"Ngh...rgh..."[lr]::
29958::$$$message_0219_0023_0001$$$::My outline blurs.[lr]::
29959::$$$message_0219_0023_0002$$$::I'm about to lose my footing.[lr]::
29960::$$$message_0219_0023_0003$$$::"...It's all right. You can bear this."[lr]::
29961::$$$message_0219_0023_0004$$$::And then,[lr]::
29962::$$$message_0219_0023_0005$$$::the firm fingers in my hand completely deny it from happening.::
29963::$$$message_0219_0024_0000$$$::"...Yeah. Ending something is different from not continuing it.[lr]::
29964::$$$message_0219_0024_0001$$$::As long as I'm here, things will never continue."[lr]::
29965::$$$message_0219_0024_0002$$$::I'm close enough to the void now that I could reach out and touch it.[lr]::
29966::$$$message_0219_0024_0003$$$::Her fingers will be alone once I do so.[lr]::
29967::$$$message_0219_0024_0004$$$::Clouds cover the earth, while I approach the stars.::
29968::$$$message_0219_0025_0000$$$::"...Hey. Why are you ending this wish?"[lr]::
29969::$$$message_0219_0025_0001$$$::Suddenly, she asks me in a subdued voice.[lr]::
29970::$$$message_0219_0025_0002$$$::Why? I can't recall.[lr]::
29971::$$$message_0219_0025_0003$$$::But I still clearly remember what I wanted to do the most.[lr]::
29972::$$$message_0219_0025_0004$$$::The end of this path.[lr]::
29973::$$$message_0219_0025_0005$$$::I'm going to set free the woman who's stubbornly protecting the Holy Grail, in this black cocoon.::
29974::$$$message_0219_0026_0000$$$::"Even though she's trying to kill you? Why do you care so much about her?"[lr]::
29975::$$$message_0219_0026_0001$$$::I don't need a reason.[lr]::
29976::$$$message_0219_0026_0002$$$::Anger and emotion drove me to embrace her.[lr]::
29977::$$$message_0219_0026_0003$$$::Longing and love inspire me to look after her.::
29978::$$$message_0219_0027_0000$$$::"...How unexpected. I thought you were a misanthrope."[lr]::
29979::$$$message_0219_0027_0001$$$::Of course, I don't like them. Just as many humans loathe their own kind, I'll keep hating them.[lr]::
29980::$$$message_0219_0027_0002$$$::My malice was born from justice which rejected weakness.[lr]::
29981::$$$message_0219_0027_0003$$$::Since I've been enshrined as an enemy, I'll continue to fulfill my function.::
29982::$$$message_0219_0028_0000$$$::That will never change.[lr]::
29983::$$$message_0219_0028_0001$$$::Evil isn't born. It's created.[lr]::
29984::$$$message_0219_0028_0002$$$::There are weak humans. But weak individuals exist in any ecosystem. The evil of a single life is immaterial to the natural world.[lr]::
29985::$$$message_0219_0028_0003$$$::It's said that paradigm itself is evil, in which humans are both the strongest and the weakest.[lr]::
29986::$$$message_0219_0028_0004$$$::Human sentiment fosters depravity and lights fires.[lr]::
29987::$$$message_0219_0028_0005$$$::A leader isn't anyone special, and the numerous indifferent individuals who fail to become leaders distort those who stand atop them.::
29988::$$$message_0219_0029_0000$$$::They are lives which simply glorify life.[lr]::
29989::$$$message_0219_0029_0001$$$::They bring out gods and affirm their own prosperity, while denying their own wickedness.[lr]::
29990::$$$message_0219_0029_0002$$$::All the evil in the world is laughable.[lr]::
29991::$$$message_0219_0029_0003$$$::That describes humanity as a whole. Humans gave rise to the ego. As long as you are human, you can recreate any form of evil.::
29992::$$$message_0219_0030_0000$$$::Ugly individuals. Ugly societies. Ugly concepts.[lr]::
29993::$$$message_0219_0030_0001$$$::It's undeniable. They're creatures which label their own kind as evil, and there's something wrong about that very way of being.[lr]::
29994::$$$message_0219_0030_0002$$$::But...::
29995::$$$message_0219_0031_0000$$$::"But still, life has value.[lr]::
29996::$$$message_0219_0031_0001$$$::Even for creatures that commit evil.[l][say storage=eming12_anr_0152 name=アンリ] Even if humans are worthless, the history they've built still means something.[lr]::
29997::$$$message_0219_0031_0002$$$::They might keep on being wrong forever...[l][say storage=eming12_anr_0154 name=アンリ]but as long as their hands can still accomplish something, there will absolutely be things they can save."[lr]::
29998::$$$message_0219_0031_0003$$$::Just like a journey to reach the stars.[lr]::
29999::$$$message_0219_0031_0004$$$::I climb the long, long stairs, aiming for the far, far sky.::
30000::$$$message_0219_0032_0000$$$::"I've thought this for a while, but..."[lr]::
30001::$$$message_0219_0032_0001$$$::Slight relief.[lr]::
30002::$$$message_0219_0032_0002$$$::The girl smiles.[lr]::
30003::$$$message_0219_0032_0003$$$::"You're like a rock star."[lr]::
30004::$$$message_0219_0032_0004$$$::Her voice is like a bird in song.::
30005::$$$message_0219_0033_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
30006::$$$message_0219_0033_0001$$$::I don't understand the comparison, but being compared to a star isn't so bad.[lr]::
30007::$$$message_0219_0033_0002$$$::It's true that you can never touch the stars.[lr]::
30008::$$$message_0219_0033_0003$$$::They're one of the few bright things I can see.::
30009::$$$message_0219_0034_0000$$$::The sky is close.[lr]::
30010::$$$message_0219_0034_0001$$$::The human world is about to end.[lr]::
30011::$$$message_0219_0034_0002$$$::No one who didn't originally exist beyond this point can enter it.[lr]::
30012::$$$message_0219_0034_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
30013::$$$message_0219_0034_0004$$$::I don't need to say anything.[lr]::
30014::$$$message_0219_0034_0005$$$::Just like when I left the surface, her body also begins to fade from view, as if to signal the end.::
30015::$$$message_0219_0035_0000$$$::"Ah..."[lr]::
30016::$$$message_0219_0035_0001$$$::I search my mind for any last words to leave her.[lr]::
30017::$$$message_0219_0035_0002$$$::I can't think of anything clever, but I do remember something I forgot to say before.[lr]::
30018::$$$message_0219_0035_0003$$$::"I think I might know your father."[lr]::
30019::$$$message_0219_0035_0004$$$::"I see. I don't mind. It should be obvious enough who he is by now."[lr]::
30020::$$$message_0219_0035_0005$$$::She replies readily.[lr]::
30021::$$$message_0219_0035_0006$$$::If that's her answer, then this topic is over.::
30022::$$$message_0219_0036_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
30023::$$$message_0219_0036_0001$$$::The conversation dies off, leaving only the sound of the wind.[lr]::
30024::$$$message_0219_0036_0002$$$::I don't stop walking, nor do I take my eyes off the sky.[lr]::
30025::$$$message_0219_0036_0003$$$::I've already lost more than half the feeling of her fingers in mine.[lr]::
30026::$$$message_0219_0036_0004$$$::If I try to grip them harder to hang on to my uncertain sense of touch, we'll probably both realize that we've become illusions.::
30027::$$$message_0219_0037_0000$$$::I've known all along that we were illusions.[lr]::
30028::$$$message_0219_0037_0001$$$::We never existed in this town. These four days might have been fake, but they'll remain for everyone else. Our trysts, however, will disappear without a trace.[lr]::
30029::$$$message_0219_0037_0002$$$::No matter how real this girl is,[lr]::
30030::$$$message_0219_0037_0003$$$::we were never meant to meet in reality.::
30031::$$$message_0219_0038_0000$$$::"...I do regret that, a little."[lr]::
30032::$$$message_0219_0038_0001$$$::I came here intending to leave nothing, but I have one lingering attachment.[lr]::
30033::$$$message_0219_0038_0002$$$::The only time I spent as myself was with this girl.[lr]::
30034::$$$message_0219_0038_0003$$$::It hurts a little to think that time will be gone, too.::
30035::$$$message_0219_0039_0000$$$::"...Well, it's already over.[lr]::
30036::$$$message_0219_0039_0001$$$::Okay. Let's leave it at that."[lr]::
30037::$$$message_0219_0039_0002$$$::I only feel her pinky finger now.[lr]::
30038::$$$message_0219_0039_0003$$$::It's partly see-through.[lr]::
30039::$$$message_0219_0039_0004$$$::She stops walking, while I keep going.[lr]::
30040::$$$message_0219_0039_0005$$$::Our connection easily melts back into nothing, as if it never existed.::
30041::$$$message_0219_0040_0000$$$::"Bye. When I'm gone, go see him again."[lr]::
30042::$$$message_0219_0040_0001$$$::Not for myself...[lr]::
30043::$$$message_0219_0040_0002$$$::...but for these meaningless memories that never existed.::
30044::$$$message_0219_0041_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=false time=600][say storage=eming12_kar_0130 name=カレン]I cannot guarantee what I'll do after I return. I might even be ordered to return home immediately once my mission ends."[lr]::
30045::$$$message_0219_0041_0001$$$::As if.[lr]::
30046::$$$message_0219_0041_0002$$$::I know how much she loves rubbing salt in people's wounds, so there's no way she'd leave and pass up a chance to torment that weirdo.::
30047::$$$message_0219_0042_0000$$$::"How were the four days to you?"[lr]::
30048::$$$message_0219_0042_0001$$$::"Me? Well, I can't say I dislike this town."[lr]::
30049::$$$message_0219_0042_0002$$$::Then there's no problem. If that's how she feels in here, then her real self on the outside would agree.[lr]::
30050::$$$message_0219_0042_0003$$$::It's a pathetic regret, but it feels a little lighter now.::
30051::$$$message_0219_0043_0000$$$::"Yeah. It doesn't matter whether it's in that depressing church or that circus of a house.[lr]::
30052::$$$message_0219_0043_0001$$$::Until we meet again, Caren. I'll be a little more gentlemanly next time, since you asked."[lr]::
30053::$$$message_0219_0043_0002$$$::The foul-mouthed devil isn't possessing anyone now.::
30054::$$$message_0219_0044_0000$$$::The presence behind me vanishes.[lr]::
30055::$$$message_0219_0044_0001$$$::"Goodbye, Aŋra Mainiiu. I'll make an exception and not exorcise you."[lr]::
30056::$$$message_0219_0044_0002$$$::The wind immediately drowns out her slight warmth.[lr]::
30057::$$$message_0219_0044_0003$$$::I don't need to turn around to know that the white flower is gone.[lr]::
30058::$$$message_0219_0044_0004$$$::I lied when I said I felt lighter. [wait canskip=false time=1000]This weight will never lessen.::
30059::$$$message_0219_0045_0000$$$::   I can see the final stop.[lr]::
30060::$$$message_0219_0045_0001$$$::The threads of salvation falling to the earth gradually decrease in number.::
30061::$$$message_0219_0046_0000$$$::The surface is so far away now.[lr]::
30062::$$$message_0219_0046_0001$$$::While they are being blocked by Guardians, the dead are probably watching me climb up.[lr]::
30063::$$$message_0219_0046_0002$$$::...Just like the way I gazed at the stars from the peak of the mountain, in the distant past.[lr]::
30064::$$$message_0219_0046_0003$$$::I was resentful and jealous of their fading light.::

